{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NwHD1vZQWyMyvhs8tmH7v7","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile the complete response with all the requested structs, enums, and constants.\n\n## Summary of Rust Source Files\n\nHere are the complete definitions from the picoquic Rust sources:\n\n### **PacketContext Enum** (`lib.rs` lines 248-252)\n```rust\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]\n#[repr(u8)]\npub enum PacketContext {\n    Application = 0,\n    Handshake = 1,\n    Initial = 2,\n}\n```\n\n### **CongestionNotification Enum** (`lib.rs` lines 650-671)\n```rust\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]\npub enum CongestionNotification {\n    Acknowledgement,\n    Repeat,\n    Timeout,\n    SpuriousRepeat,\n    RttMeasurement,\n    EcnEc,\n    CwinBlocked,\n    SeedCwin,\n    Reset,\n    LostFeedback,\n}\n```\n\n### **PacketContextState Struct** (`internal.rs` lines 1142-1167)\n```rust\npub struct PacketContextState {\n    pub send_sequence: u64,\n    pub next_sequence_hole: u64,\n    pub retransmit_sequence: u64,\n    pub highest_acknowledged: u64,\n    pub latest_time_acknowledged: Instant,\n    pub highest_acknowledged_time: Instant,\n    pub pending: BTreeMap<u64, PacketToken>,\n    pub retransmitted: BTreeMap<u64, PacketToken>,\n    pub preemptive_repeat_seq: Option<u64>,\n    pub retransmitted_queue_size: u64,\n    pub ecn_ect0_total_remote: u64,\n    pub ecn_ect1_total_remote: u64,\n    pub ecn_ce_total_remote: u64,\n    pub ack_of_ack_requested: bool,\n}\n```\n\n### **PerAckState Struct** (`lib.rs` lines 681-695)\n```rust\n#[derive(Debug, Copy, Clone)]\npub struct PerAckState {\n    pub rtt_measurement: Duration,\n    pub send_delay: Duration,\n    pub one_way_delay: Duration,\n    pub nb_bytes_acknowledged: u64,\n    pub nb_bytes_newly_lost: u64,\n    pub nb_bytes_lost_since_packet_sent: u64,\n    pub nb_bytes_delivered_since_packet_se